# Mosquitto ACL: an allowlist, one user per service (architecture.md, "ACL").
# `write` = publish, `read` = subscribe/receive, `readwrite` = both.
# Only the owner of a branch may write it. The AI services get no `_sim/#` access at all,
# so ground-truth fault labels cannot leak into the models (ADR-0012).
# Every change here needs a matching change in tests/test_acl.py expectations.

user simulator
topic write edge/raw/#
topic write pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/lab/#
topic readwrite pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/state/#
topic write pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/events/#
topic readwrite _sim/clock
topic write _sim/faults/#
topic read _sim/cmd/#
# Freiburg's API stock (ADR-0020): its own, and the stock bootstrap hands over.
topic readwrite _sim/inventory
topic read _sim/opening_stock
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/simulator/#

# One-shot first start: hands the backfilled stock to the simulator (ADR-0020).
user bootstrap
topic write _sim/opening_stock

user edge-adapter
topic read edge/raw/#
topic read pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/state/batch
topic write pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/pv/#
topic write pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/sp/#
topic write edge/unmapped
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/tags/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/edge-adapter/#

user historian
topic read pharmanextgen/#
topic read _sim/faults/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/historian/#

user graph-sync
topic read pharmanextgen/#
topic read _sim/faults/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/graph-sync/#

user anomaly
topic read pharmanextgen/#
topic write pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/ai/anomaly/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/anomaly/#

user yield
topic read pharmanextgen/#
topic write pharmanextgen/+/+/+/+/ai/yield/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/yield/#

user dashboard
topic read pharmanextgen/#
topic read edge/#
topic read _sim/clock
topic read _sim/faults/#
topic read _sim/inventory
topic write _sim/cmd/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/dashboard/#

# The i3X read API (ADR-0016). Anything it serves an LLM may see, so no `_sim/#`.
user i3x
topic read pharmanextgen/#
topic write pharmanextgen/_meta/i3x/#

# Compose healthcheck only.
user healthcheck
topic read $SYS/#

# Read-only, for MQTT Explorer and local debugging by a person.
user explorer
topic read #
